<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78314" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλέχομαι</span></b>  (pres. not found), 
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lie beside</i> or
				<i>with</i>, of intercourse with a woman, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δέ οἱ παρελέξατο λάθρῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.515
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				20.224
			</span></i>, etc. ; of the woman, <i>lie down beside</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ δὲ Βρισηῒς παρελέξατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.676
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλέξομαι ἐν φιλότητι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.237
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πὰρ δ᾽ Ἑλένη . . ἐλέξατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.305
				</span></i>
			 : 
				Ep.
			
			aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέλεκτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ven.</u>
					167
				</span></i>
			 : Com., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυρῷ καὶ μίνθῃ π. καὶ ἐλαίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					129
				</span></i>
			 (dub.).</div>
